    <string name="support_faq_title">Setup &amp; Troubleshooting FAQ</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">Why are GCC servers marked Pending VPS?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">NEXORA never fakes servers or IPs. Each GCC city slot (SA01–OM01) stays Pending VPS until you run setup-wg-vps.sh on a real Linux VPS and register its node agent with PostgreSQL.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">How do I connect a private WireGuard server without the backend?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Tap Import .conf or Manual Config in the Servers tab to import any standard WireGuard configuration file directly into GoBackend.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">How does Speed Test work without SpeedOf.Me API keys?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">When SpeedOf.Me credentials are configured, NEXORA runs the official SpeedOf.Me JS engine. If unconfigured, it automatically runs real multi-megabyte HTTPS probes against Cloudflare Edge.</string>
